  "prefLabel": "Lot 7002.17 Gaming consultant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7002.17 “Gaming consultant” means “gaming consultant” as defined in RSA 287-E:1, VI-b, namely “any individual or business entity who is hired by or otherwise receives compensation from a charitable organization to provide gaming related services including consultation, management, assistance with the operation of the bingo game or the sale of lucky 7 tickets, record keeping, filing forms with the commission, advertising, or security and who handles, manages, oversees, or disburses any of the funds derived from the operation of the charitable games”.\n\nSource. #13067, eff 6-26-20; ss by #14138, eff 11-27-24, EXPIRES: 11-27-34 (formerly Lot 7002.14)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot7000.html"
